Third-party software

This program does not bundle, link, or redistribute any third-party code,
model, or asset. It uses only the Python standard library.

It invokes the following as separate external programs, which the user
installs and licenses independently:

  - ffmpeg / ffprobe   (invoked as external processes)
  - LM Studio          (contacted over a local HTTP API on 127.0.0.1)

Vision-language models and Whisper models are not distributed with this
program. The user supplies them and remains subject to each model's own
license.
